      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>This black looking lizard can breathe out an earthen breath and loves sandy areas. They're known to blind unsuspecting foes.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 20, touch 12, flat-footed 17 (+3 dex, +8 natural, -1 size)</p><p>hp 78 (8d10+32)</p><p>Fort +10, Ref +9, Will +5</p><p>Weakness Water</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 40 ft., Climb 20 ft., Swim 20 ft.</p><p>Melee Bite +13 (2d6+5), Tail Slap +7 (1d8+5)</p><p>Space 10 ft.; Reach 10 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Breath Weapon (20-ft. cone, 6d6 earth damage, Reflex DC 18, usable every 1d4 rounds), Sandstorm</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 21, Dex 16, Con 18, Int 3, Wis 16, Cha 7</p><p>Base Atk +8; CMB +14; CMD 27 (31 vs trip)</p><p>Feats Cleave, Improved Initiative, Power Attack, Weapon Focus (Bite)</p><p>Skills Climb +14, Perception +14, Stealth +12, Swim +14; Racial Modifiers +2 Perception, +4 Stealth</p>"
